            <p>“Very professional and reliable. Communication is smooth, deadlines are always met, and the whole process feels effortless on my end. Every video comes back polished, engaging, and exactly aligned with what I had in mind (often even better than I envisioned myself). If you're looking for someone who combines technical skill with creative intuition, I highly recommend you work with Gabryan!”</p>
          </blockquote>
          <div class="review__stars" role="img" aria-label="Rated 5 out of 5 stars">
            <svg class="star" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-star"/></svg>
            <svg class="star" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-star"/></svg>
            <svg class="star" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-star"/></svg>
            <svg class="star" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-star"/></svg>
